{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11233010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11233010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11233010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123301001:0":{"text":"마스터, 하쉬르를 보러 가야 하지 않을까요?","source_cn":"主人，我们是不是该看看哈什尔了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xACBC21B24E3FC1AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 하쉬르를 보러 가야 하지 않을까요?","female":"마스터, 하쉬르를 보러 가야 하지 않을까요?","variant_male_record_index":"127603","variant_female_record_index":"127604","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123301002:0":{"text":"바보 치피! 뭘 기대하고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"笨蛋满满，你怎么那么期待呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB45C679DDA5F2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123301003:0":{"text":"음... 하쉬르가 무례하다는 걸 인정하고 나니까 그렇게 나쁘진 않은 거 같아서!","source_cn":"嗯……只是接受了他蛮横的一面，觉得也没那么糟糕啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB06B25EB23DEFCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11233020.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11233020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11233020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123302001:1":{"text":"괜찮아요? 무슨 일 있어요?","source_cn":"您还好吗？出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FAF1A447B5C21F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123302002:1":{"text":"괜찮을 리가! 젊은 시절의 적은 내 눈앞에 서 있는 존재라면, 늙은 후의 적은 내 몸뚱아리라는 말이 있지!","source_cn":"怎么会好？年轻的时候敌人都实实在在站在面前，上了年纪敌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341A2EA64ACFB088","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123302003:1":{"text":"하쉬르가 넘어질 것 같아요! 치피, 어서!","source_cn":"哈什尔要摔倒了！满满快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD32FD985A8639A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123302004:1":{"text":"잡았어! 괜찮으세요?","source_cn":"扶住了！您没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9247FBB0E11D0EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123302005:1":{"text":"호들갑 떨지 마라. 발을 헛디딘 것뿐이니까. 헉... 헉.","source_cn":"别大惊小怪的，我只是一步没站稳而已，呼……呼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5925C4D3A8BDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123302006:1":{"text":"그런데 이 털뭉치... 힘이... 보기보다 꽤 좋구나.","source_cn":"没想到……你这小毛团劲儿还挺大的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF108720745143B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123302007:1":{"text":"헤헤, 치피는 기사니까요! 기사는 힘이 세야 해요!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，满满是骑士！骑士就要有大力气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FB609B5A210806E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1123302007":{"text":"헤헤, 치피는 기사니까요! 기사는 힘이 세야 해요!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，满满是骑士！骑士就要有大力气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FB609B5A210806E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123302008:1":{"text":"뱀뼈풀.","source_cn":"蛇骨草。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFF463F4B0607E4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123302009:1":{"text":"잘은 모르겠지만, 이 근처에서 뱀뼈풀을 기르고 계시던 거 아니에요?","source_cn":"虽然不太确定，您身边种植的不就是蛇骨草吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD87377677CE62CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1123302010:1":{"text":"그건 아직 덜 자란데다 개수도 한참 모자라!","source_cn":"这些还未成熟，并且数量也远远不够。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0264170DA42F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1123302011:1":{"text":"마침 여기까지 왔으니 이 자루 받고, 가서 다 자란 뱀뼈풀을 좀 모아오거라.","source_cn":"既然你们来了，袋子拿去，给我取一些成熟的蛇骨草来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE05A9BB19BC94CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1123302012:1":{"text":"이건... 골드잖아요?","source_cn":"这袋子里的……是金币？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70EA441960BFD2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1123302012":{"text":"이건... 골드잖아요?","source_cn":"这袋子里的……是金币？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70EA441960BFD2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1123302013:1":{"text":"네 녀석 같은 괴짜는 또 처음 보는구나. ","source_cn":"头一次见到你这种怪人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23FE78223A9FABF9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 녀석 같은 괴짜는 또 처음 보는구나. ","female":"네 녀석 같은 괴짜는 또 처음 보는구나. ","variant_male_record_index":"127619","variant_female_record_index":"127620","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1123302014:1":{"text":"그래. 어쨌든 길바닥에서 굴러먹는 노인네에게 이런 건 별 의미가 없지.","source_cn":"好吧，反正这些对于我这个野外求生的老人来说，已经没什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E2D4EED71BB744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1123302015:1":{"text":"하지만 내가 다 자란 뱀뼈풀을 필요로 한다는 건 잊지 말거라. ","source_cn":"不过记住，我需要成熟的蛇骨草。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDECDF101F8CE8849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"오케이, 하지만 골드는 거절한다","source_cn":"答应，并拒绝钱袋","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A05E04CD83E21C5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오케이, 하지만 골드는 거절한다","female":"오케이, 하지만 골드는 거절한다","variant_male_record_index":"64892","variant_female_record_index":"64893","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"뱀뼈풀을 다 모으면 가지러 오라고 한다","source_cn":"告知采完蛇骨草才来领","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x716C3E9934FD8E9F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뱀뼈풀을 다 모으면 가지러 오라고 한다","female":"뱀뼈풀을 다 모으면 가지러 오라고 한다","variant_male_record_index":"64894","variant_female_record_index":"64895","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"뭔가 찾고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"你是在找什么吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0340C177A8F0A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뭔가 찾고 있는 거야?","female":"뭔가 찾고 있는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"64888","variant_female_record_index":"64889","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"뭐가 부족해?","source_cn":"缺什么东西了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x01FF88AA2ED95A3D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뭐가 부족해?","female":"뭐가 부족해?","variant_male_record_index":"64890","variant_female_record_index":"64891","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f